From {{etyl|sla-pro|be}} {{m|sla-pro|*slonъ}}, possibly a deverbative from *{{term||sloniti sę|to lean against}}, relating to а medieval story of а sleeping elephant who leaned against a tree. According to some other sources, it's related to the Turkish {{term|aslan||lion|lang=tr}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Be-слон.ogg|Audio|lang=be}}

===Noun===
